# Line endings
#
# The repo stores text as LF and the app is built and served from Linux, but
# core.autocrlf=true on Windows checks files out as CRLF. Prettier's endOfLine
# defaults to "lf", so every line of every checked-out file was reported as an
# error. Pinning eol=lf makes the working tree match the index on all platforms.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never convert these.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.webp  binary
*.pdf   binary
*.docx  binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.pptx  binary
*.zip   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.eot   binary
